# Outport content

Single log at `/outport`. Entries are anchored sections (`/outport#2026-08-30`), not separate pages. Staged: `noindex`, not on Works index, direct URL only.

## Series header

`src/content/outport/series.json` (singleton, not in the content collection):

- `title`, `medium`, `year`, `seoDescription`, `description`
- `cover` / `coverFallback` / `coverAlt` for header hero, OG, and (at go-live) Works card

Separate from per-post `cover: true` image cells (RSS item images only).

## Entry frontmatter

One file per post: `src/content/outport/<slug>.md`

| Field | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `slug` | Anchor id (`YYYY-MM-DD` or `YYYY-MM-DD-a`). Never change once shared. |
| `date` | Sort order + RSS pub date |
| `draft` | `true` = dev only; production omits draft entries |
| `rows` | Grid rows (see below) |

## Grid rules

4 columns per row. Cell `span` values must sum to **4**.

Cell types: `image` · `video` · `text` · `empty` · `space`

- `empty`: occupies a column slot (negative space)
- `space`: full-row vertical gap (`span: 4`, `size`: `s` · `m` · `l` · `xl` · `2xl` · `3xl`)

Optional on any cell except `space`: media cells use `align: top` or `align: bottom` only (see Text cells for full alignment).

Published posts need exactly one `cover: true` on an **image** cell (RSS + feed image).

Landscape video must be `span` 2 or more.

Optional on image, video, and empty cells: `align: top` (default) or `align: bottom` to pin media to the row baseline when neighbours are taller.

## Text cells

`style` selects typography (default `small`):

| `style` | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `title` | Large title (Google Sans Flex; scales with span) |
| `quote` | Pull quote; optional `attrib` (no side rule) |
| `micro` | Uppercase label, place/date line |
| `small` | Body copy; blank lines in `body` split into paragraphs |

Optional surface fields:

| Field | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `border` | `true` for a thin light grey border |
| `background` | CSS colour (e.g. `#f7f7f7`) |
| `color` | Text colour |

`align` on text cells (default `top-left`; vertical centre is forced in CSS for now):

| Value | Position |
| --- | --- |
| `top-left` · `top` · `top-right` | Top row (`top` = top centre) |
| `left` · `center` · `right` | Middle row |
| `bottom-left` · `bottom` · `bottom-right` | Bottom row (`bottom` = bottom centre) |

`body` supports inline markdown via `inlineMarkdown` (links only).

All text cells use `min-height` = one column width (`100cqw / span`).

## Image / video metadata

Optional on media cells: `title`, `place`, `date`, `people`, `caption`

Images only: `cover: true` (one per published post)

Video: `src`, `poster`, `width`, `height`, `alt`; optional `audio` bed URL (separate m4a, not mp4 soundtrack)

## Publishing workflow

1. Drop source files in `_inbox/outport/<slug>/`
2. Describe layout in chat (grid order left-to-right, top-to-bottom)
3. Run `node scripts/outport-media.mjs <slug>` → R2 URLs + dimensions
4. Write `src/content/outport/<slug>.md` with `rows` in frontmatter
5. Preview in dev (`astro dev --background`); drafts visible when `draft: true`
6. Commit; GitHub Actions deploys Pages

No automatic spacing between entry sections. Use `space` rows to breathe between posts.

## People + consent

Only name people in `people` when they have agreed to appear on the public site.

